  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C01",
      "text": "天亮前，路边那两辆货车，开进了物流园的B七库位。我租下它，当中转仓。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "17e85fed780532791ded16ecfdf4849d0574debba1ccc301c4019fbe1a01df41",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.626145833333333,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 169,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C01.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "9e2ada3202269c24fc94976795541e6a518be6a9f634071499e2146943f4fab6",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "sample_count": 270055
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C02",
      "text": "清晨五点，粮油批发市场。老李拍着米袋说，新米，一吨四千二。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "5229b45297f99d6b1bc2bcb85e4f8a79daaa5b986186d62374ccec2237f583a5",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.466520833333333,
      "start_frame": 172,
      "end_frame": 336,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C02.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "5349c0c867dd67da6e6ffaecff513aa4976bc85d51caf74b2ca489edcf096fd3",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "sample_count": 262393
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C03",
      "text": "我抓起一把米，在掌心捻开，闻了闻。这是去年九月的米，仓里返过潮。我只要近三个月的，三千二。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0468e912c8b66a05372599d7b11dd49c528f91c40fc6d06c661015e4c16ba74a",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.821270833333333,
      "start_frame": 339,
      "end_frame": 574,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C03.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ed9fbf2a2c592ed7f7725460a1203cd05554bb0bcfc6826bf044f09948adba25",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.193563,
      "sample_count": 375421
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C04",
      "text": "老李愣住，问我，你是同行？我说，做过仓储。三千二，你不亏。他吐出一口烟，成交。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "063126a975edc735eec33396a8e3e9cb74d08c2f16c70bc501b9b07914c8f427",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.2034375,
      "start_frame": 577,
      "end_frame": 794,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C04.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "b254df8a3ccf77c0f22370ed6fbd20d1f42372a4029424afd20c8a65a09b00e9",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.380875,
      "sample_count": 345765
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C05",
      "text": "接下来一周，我的小本子，一页页划勾。大米二十吨，面粉十吨，盐、油、罐头、饮用水，柴油和气罐，发电机，种子，羽绒服，还有二十台探照灯。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "d2191eb3cbf6a4aeef223e452872d6da8aeb04bf2a8b18e5c9ca943f97287918",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 12.335479166666667,
      "start_frame": 797,
      "end_frame": 1168,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C05.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "2f9baaa91ebcb35078056593fa6ae4ff1113222464e6790be8388afc2fcd2c5d",
      "source_duration_seconds": 16.079844,
      "sample_count": 592103
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C06",
      "text": "老李问，买探照灯干什么。我说，防小偷。其实我本子上写着，怕光，怕火，耳朵灵。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "522981c448babcbc4155d573c185d24df25bcf3aa56c8c140e795aa8e709bf8f",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.5235,
      "start_frame": 1171,
      "end_frame": 1397,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C06.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f3607fa4b5abf92bba833de5a1472823d5a5a1aa332a5e72780af4c970619710",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "sample_count": 361128
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C07",
      "text": "货车到了，我蹲在车上，教工人交错码垛，垫板，放脱氧剂。码得好，十年不坏。工人说，陈老板，你比我们老板还专业。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4d4fc6a02b2a84a740b3b44b6d4446cc67e6d0dfbf12033f2127dd5a7c2d3d84",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.958229166666667,
      "start_frame": 1400,
      "end_frame": 1699,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C07.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "abf3d44a0aa9959026e9fd05e0ce6d542fe82d75cfed145a21815c73bba0325b",
      "source_duration_seconds": 12.968375,
      "sample_count": 477995
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C08",
      "text": "燃料我全放在物流园，一滴都没往小区运。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e021b6f82b35a1174044d0d00b9cf8a39889d95cdd7d61a0684b967893816e6a",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.203333333333333,
      "start_frame": 1702,
      "end_frame": 1799,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C08.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "1f3358191e73864606f364be39359e24a5dfdb6514265089731a548bd9c7d3a2",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "sample_count": 153760
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C09",
      "text": "可王大富，已经把我的聊天记录截了图，发进业主群。本栋有人精神异常，大量囤积危险品。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c1c3fbb530bcb3b3a13658055a7dbadc5c04400370017d66ceb7fa6db529d769",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.862583333333333,
      "start_frame": 1802,
      "end_frame": 2008,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C09.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "5c0507ff6639c3850beb28b60218e767d225d7ae1e583c2444f3122455d7b888",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "sample_count": 329404
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C10",
      "text": "群里一片哈哈哈。楼下的孩子追着我喊，末日叔叔。我提着一袋面粉，目不斜视。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "24f5b6fd1226875e1d85f6940226a6a4df92edb20f22e707fcb31763eed64f31",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.004,
      "start_frame": 2011,
      "end_frame": 2192,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C10.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "2be9808542e331a7130669eaaf521092cc7403498dc9303ec710a25b7aeb1a8a",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "sample_count": 288192
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C11",
      "text": "我在群里回了一个字，嗯。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "da5b849f422471b72a8b5ca701e03c1d445e1f1baadb1a764ca7347aef1b93c2",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 2.214916666666667,
      "start_frame": 2195,
      "end_frame": 2262,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C11.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "afd919b4cfb3bff4528624334cd2a3f41f4366847456b899f10adea2acfa81fa",
      "source_duration_seconds": 2.890906,
      "sample_count": 106316
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C12",
      "text": "单元门上，物业新贴了通知，禁止堆放易燃物。我看了一眼，转身去了物流园。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "8fbfd182729e4221e07acfde1ef8ced60a798e6dfc7be2a4482414e98e49b83d",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.6253125,
      "start_frame": 2265,
      "end_frame": 2434,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C12.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "e6acbee8279f51be9d68500918244243117d4ffc986682ad81a858cdeb1d5a0e",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "sample_count": 270015
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C13",
      "text": "那晚，园区经理来电，说有批货的报备资料不全，今晚必须补。我带着合同赶到B七库，库门刚拉开，一道手电光，直直照在我脸上。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/speed1p3/EP004-C13.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "40c5dc10ba3155e3b73497c1f4c828ae7c1bc45e764e5fb0b5eb4358a9005b52",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 10.293458333333334,
      "start_frame": 2437,
      "end_frame": 2746,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C13.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ce325fba5a9794cf5df08093d7fe685838e660c729e0922fc036e79c941b1481",
      "source_duration_seconds": 13.4,
      "sample_count": 494086
    }
  ],
